  "consts": [
   "core/parsers/control_sheet.py - A&F-style \"Control Sheet\" layout (ISOLATED).\n\nA \"Control Sheet\" PO is a 2-page block: a \"Control Sheet\" page carrying header\nfields as ``Label: value`` pairs (PO#, Style, Color, Fashion Color, Quantity,\nCost, PO Total$, ...) plus a \"Pack Ratio\" table, followed by a \"Fabrics\" detail\npage. Every PO is ONE style + ONE colour + ONE total quantity.\n\nThis parser is deliberately SELF-CONTAINED: it reads only ``recipe.field_map``\nanchors (populated at synthesis time with generic ``Label: value`` patterns) and\nthe shared ``BaseParser``. It never touches matrix_1axis / matrix_2axis /\nline_items or the shared ``size_columns`` / ``split_row_total`` helpers, so the\nexisting architectures are unaffected.\n\n``field_map`` keys used (all optional): entity, po_no, style, product_desc,\ncolor_code, color_desc, quantity, unit_price, total_amount, ship_date, season,\nsize_rng.\n",
